&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Kaaybi/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Kaaybi"&gt;@Kaaybi&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4109582861" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3169" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3169/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3169"&gt;#3169&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
