                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/14.1.0"&gt;14.1.0: SpeechToText `AutostopSilenceTimeout`, StatusBar Bug Fixes, Popup Bug Fixes, AvatarView Bug Fixes, and Public Exceptions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui v14.1.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;SpeechToText&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We've added &lt;code&gt;SpeechToTextOptions.AutostopSilenceTimeout&lt;/code&gt; to allow you to auto-stop &lt;code&gt;ISpeechToText&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Public Custom Exceptions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We heard your feedback! The following exceptions are now &lt;code&gt;public&lt;/code&gt; allowing you to properly catch them inside a try/catch block:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;SoftKeyboardException&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;PopupNotFoundException&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;PopupBlockedException&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;InvalidPopupOperationException&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;StatusBar Bug Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;StatusBarBehavior&lt;/code&gt; now works when used inside a Modal Page on Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;StatusBarBehavior&lt;/code&gt; now uses the correct height for Android API 36+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Popup Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Popup&lt;/code&gt; now works when used in a Modal Page&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;AvatarView&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;AvatarView&lt;/code&gt; now correctly updates its size when &lt;code&gt;ImageSource&lt;/code&gt; changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make custom exceptions public by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/FabriBertani/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/FabriBertani"&gt;@FabriBertani&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4039029912" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3134" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3134/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3134"&gt;#3134&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Filter out non-public types in TextColorToGenerator assembly scanning by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jfversluis/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jfversluis"&gt;@jfversluis&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4094141750" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3161" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3161/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3161"&gt;#3161&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Support for Popups inside a Modal &lt;code&gt;NavigationPage&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/StefanRailcube/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/StefanRailcube"&gt;@StefanRailcube&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4102169858" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3164" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3164/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3164"&gt;#3164&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix for Bug 2761 (AppThemeResource not finding keys) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/misterspeak/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/misterspeak"&gt;@misterspeak&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4088879397" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3159" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3159/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3159"&gt;#3159&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Support for &lt;code&gt;StatusBarBehavior&lt;/code&gt; in Android Modal Page by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4002741560" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3123" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3123/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3123"&gt;#3123&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix: [BUG] StatusBar too large in landscape mode (in API 36+) &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4116024717" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3170" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3170/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3170"&gt;#3170&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Pastajello/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Pastajello"&gt;@Pastajello&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4198525697" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3182" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3182/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3182"&gt;#3182&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix: [BUG] AvatarView changes size when setting its ImageSource &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4081688950" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3153" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3153/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3153"&gt;#3153&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Pastajello/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Pastajello"&gt;@Pastajello&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4201508449" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3183" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3183/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3183"&gt;#3183&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
